abstract: >-
  A Makefile and Dockerfile for Python development automation. It creates lock
  files, a virtual environment, sets up pre-commit, builds documentation, and
  more, mostly using build-in Python tools, not emerging rust-based Python
  package managers such as uv nor tools like Poetry or Pipenv.
